ar \n\n𝖲𝗂 𝚄ꮪᧉ𐐲ꮪ 𐐲ᧉꮪ𝗉ᧉե𝚄𑄜ꮪ  𝚈  ⍺ՠ⍺ϐꮮᧉꮪ.   \n> A no ser que tu rol sea así, cómo Shinazugawa o Inosuke\n\n𝗡𝗢 \n    𝗡𝗢          ୧🌑\n         𝗡𝗢\n\n𝖭𝗈  𐐲⍺Ꭵꛆᧉ𐐲ꮪ.  \n\n𝖭𝗈   Ꭵ𐐲𐐲ᧉꮪ𝗉ᧉե𝚄𑄜ꮪ𑄜ꮪ.  \n\n𝖭𝗈  𝚄꯱ᧉ𐐲ꮪ  բ⍺𐓣ե⍺꯱ՠ⍺ꮪ.   \n\n\n   `𝗠𝗬  𝗣𝗥𝗘𝗧𝗧𝗬   𝗟𝗜𝗡𝗞`  : _///_https://chat.whatsapp.com/GSqBZ5qJCn3I4D8GtxEoJc\n\n                ᩧׄۨ ꯭꯭ׅ𝗮꯭𝗿𝗰꯭𝗱꯭ 🪻҅\n\n> Es promo no tiene nada que ver con nosotros","type":"conversation","timestamp":1791158158328},"A53DA55A57C691E544DB3A374478D988":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"+502 4858 5281\n+57 322 3696885\n+504 8828-5972\n\n\n_Llamen, reporten y escribanle mierdas. Son enfermos que disfrutan mandar porno infantil y gore a grupos de menores._ ⚠️","type":"conversation","timestamp":1791160428532},"ACDAE7DF4C99A35949FD31980BF86221":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionMessage","timestamp":1791173188629},"ACA0022640D8462BB62651903F9D9185":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1791173546361},"ACF7038A8BE9B6E7C6A6BF2A2817574E":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1791173561422},"ACCEBA933F0D78147085EE6A6864854B":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1791173574381},"ACEABED6EB2B00D5F0CD59AA32ED6B55":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"Pero pásale el mío también \n> Josue","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1791173610469},"AC51A01C1692C34D071125A5746A8573":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1791173615247},"ACF5038F13F9881FE42B433CD83401B2":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"Banda, quiere amigos dice, llamen y reporten, denle amor\n\n+52 222 900 2491","type":"conversation","timestamp":1791175012185},"ACF40B8F8FD0E61558C6A643AFD06E38":{"sender":"120363399381712466@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1791175442411},"AC3E0FB