 Premium ☆☆╮`\n\n〘 ♧ 〙Para aquellos que quieran ser bots premium ya están disponibles en la web del bot\n\nHay *100 slots* exclusivos para premium, si ya tienes bot y quieres ser premium, puedes poner `.prem token` y pasarás a ser Prem-bot sin necesidad de desvincular.\n\n> ⪩ https://blackasta.com/tienda\n> ⪩ Pueden ver sus beneficios con el comando `.prem`","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790459130708},"A5C1243016304E5862C006ECDE49B9FA":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionMessage","timestamp":1790462772890},"A52056C199C01442666DA4A485F6D3FB":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790462932835},"A55B9DE6F93C906A36F4916E8CDB59F3":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790463114327},"A5EB4B11DAD2425BD1C075D5631E96D8":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790463719459},"A5A87D118FC47E075B7087ACA3708961":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790463743956},"A5F01ABAF5F6910241B9D556DF08FA56":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790638713731},"A5B372F2104218FB500D39123E76A752":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790464001211},"A52F7ACCAC0E1494C43243640248BCD4":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790465647435},"A5F89E1E6DFB1BC460A191EACC0762C5":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790468142113},"A5DEEC414A3A1C08136C957152AB6EEC":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790468674691},"A5530BE4726CCDA444246C5BA3DE1315":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790468709171},"A5477777DC89D7467B23F5E8F5865642":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790468785225},"A584B49D541F8CD9BA1C0267F2D5092A":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790468817023},"A5B3C2D215245F92D0101BA67DDAAD32":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790469303026},"A58E8D4E12526097B51C1F1A6030EFD3":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790470060108},"A51D85DB994D021CE3EA718D8CC9ECB0":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790616699483},"A5055AC12F292EE330762BDABC15B5BA":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790645777037},"A51C7666C267E88C895A50C698481066":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790787915370},"A524A56073D910481A6698AADA8F29A2":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790787923373},"A53988F7B8B36233712E2481E8DA9EDE":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"`╰☆☆ Dudas ☆☆╮`\n\n〘 ♧ 〙 Para todos los que están preguntando cómo pueden ser bot, pueden serlo de la siguiente manera:\n\n◈ Usando `.code` en un chat que haya un bot activo\n\n◈ O desde la propia web del bot\n> https://blackasta.com/register","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790788021671},"A5910FB84B9939BC0626B4F118E80719":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790992062775},"A5C00679A71AFB08699927EB89C90456":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790992102609},"A519AC6AE8F9C6183A2E4D36CB349082":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790992352457},"A59FF78B801E1E8E16883FCB2234C37D":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1790992641655},"A57ABF4893B0E2D2AF78F2D24C303212":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1791001192375},"A587F521845795586038183D65E06196":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"`╰☆☆ Correcciones ☆☆╮`\n\n〘 ♧ 〙 Buenas a todos se han corregido algunos Bugs que habían en el *bot*:\n\n◈ Los *VIP ya funcionan correctamente*, ahora el bot identifica bien el jid y el lid del usuario\n\n◈ Se han corregido *las rachas diarias y semanales* del bot.\n\n◈ Los *GIFs* de la categoría Fun ahora ya funcionan con `gifts on/off`.\n\n◈ `gitclone` valida el repositorio y comprueba que la descarga sea un ZIP válido antes de enviarla.\n\n*Todas las correcciones ya están aplicadas correctamente en todos los bots*\n\n> Si tienen alguna duda o error con el bot, pueden unirse al grupo y se les ayudará\n> https://chat.whatsapp.com/G384Cpxfwkl5SNVElXrol8\n\n> También no olviden que pueden usar `.sug` y `.bug` para informar de sugerencias y errores","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1791252601603},"A51CC5D1812D8351FE48F76879EA49EF":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionMessage","timestamp":1791156885809},"A5BB6BB9D0A8F20596C4267E7FE5E028":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1791157242671},"A55A981B73F412CCC8FD2979086DD2A4":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"`╰☆☆ Errores ☆☆╮`\n\n〘 ♧ 〙 Buenas a todos, hay un fallo con los proxys que uso en el bot para las descargas y subidas de archivos a WhatsApp \n\n◈ Esto afecta a todos los comandos que puedan llegar a subir archivos a WhatsApp, ya sean descargas, Pinterest, y demás...\n\n◈ *Las sesiones de los subbots no se ven afectadas en esto, solo es la subida de archivos multimedia*\n\n> El error será solucionado en las próximas horas, lamento mucho las molestias, iré informando de la situacion, para cuando esté solucionado.\n\n> Lamento mucho las molestias causadas.","type":"conversation","timestamp":1791163211216},"A56779A2575FD979F226BB63B943446D":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"`╰☆☆ Correcciones ☆☆╮`\n\n〘 ♧ 〙 Buenas a todos, perdón por no avisar antes, me quedé dormido xD, todos los proxys vuelven a estar activos y funcionando a la perfección \n\n◈ Todos los comandos de descargas, búsqueda de fotos, y demás ya deberían de funcionar a la perfección\n\n> Lamento mucho las molestias causadas.","type":"conversation","timestamp":1791212780400},"A503BB3C1901F9ED853064850FCA7DC0":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionReplyMessage","timestamp":1791233767212},"A5D5425507DB0F2F77B8D1A4D70D82D7":{"sender":"120363409107506258@newsletter","text":"`╰☆☆ Actualización de comando ☆☆╮`\n\n〘 ♧ 〙 Buenas a todos, se ha actualizado el comando `inactivos`\n\n◈  Ahora se puede filtrar por días de inactividad en el grupo. \n\n◈ Ejemplos de uso:\n\n- .inactivos 1d\n> Mostrará aquellos que lleven más de *1 día* sin escribir\n- .inactivos 5d\n> Mostrará aquellos que lleven más de *5 días* sin escribir \n\n> El tiempo por defecto seguirá siendo *7 días*\n\n_*La actualización ya está aplicada en todos los bots*_\n\n> Recuerden que pueden usar el `.sug` y `.bug` para sugerencias o reportes","type":"conversation","timestamp":1791261277550}},"120363160757210405@newsletter":{"3EB03863C805342077AE":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"","type":"messageContextInfo","timestamp":1790335231841},"3EB009FF833EC14A360B1D":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Think you got it right? Check the answer and keep playing, culers! 👀👇\nhttps://ow.ly/Rtiv50ZQJoT","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790347464089},"3EB056EC2B67D6483DB447":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"BECOME PREMIUM 🔵🔴\nGet an early acces for the big games ahead 🔥\nSubscribe now 🤝 https://ow.ly/w5hm50ZRwEY","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1790353439517},"3ABB7396513A40364571":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Think you know who's played the most minutes this season? 🤔\n\nFind out 👇\nhttps://ow.ly/6mxM50ZQJrR","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1790413462277},"3A8A8D1439BDD663E079":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"React to this message if you miss Barça 💙❤️","type":"conversation","timestamp":1790438832402},"3EB0F1E6ABDA1CF315756F":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Your favourite moment of September? \nYou decide👇\nhttps://ow.ly/A4L950ZRmsT","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1790502738995},"3EB0BEF2016B13831E088D":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"La nostra vida 💙❤️","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1790523802904},"3EB031BBD175D6B3FC0D7F":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Hi ha llegats que van molt més enllà del que deixes enrere. ♾️ \nAmb el Testament Solidari de la Fundació del Barça, pots destinar part de la teva herència a ajudar infants vulnerables. \nEntra a l’enllaç i descobreix que bonic és viure després d’haver-ho viscut tot.👣\n👉 https://ow.ly/LakJ50ZRZn5","type":"videoMessage","timestamp":1790586463938},"3EB04315743C508349A203":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"🎬 Lights, camera, action \nhttps://youtu.be/F3sNTQcB1n0","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790606830396},"3EB0ED42A7A8C0233E9733":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"La història es porta ✨\nNova col·lecció retro 1992/95 ja disponible a les Barça Botiga! 💙❤️\n👕 https://ow.ly/4TLt50ZSwua","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1790670008189},"3EB056B0DCCA7FBE393576":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Flick, named LaLiga’s Coach of the Month for September! 🏆\nEnhorabona, míster! 👏","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1790687139057},"3EB00CC2D0EAD8E55F41A6":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"🍿 𝗚𝗨𝗘𝗦𝗦 𝗪𝗛𝗢 ⁉️\n⭐ Today’s stars: Balde & Marc Bernal\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RMOXgbhodfM&t=38s","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790766811141},"3EB088C54D4DF26A6B2248":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"🍿 𝗚𝗨𝗘𝗦𝗦 𝗪𝗛𝗢 ⁉️\n⭐ Today’s stars: Balde & Marc Bernal\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RMOXgbhodfM","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790766890105},"3EB0ABB92184E899F14FFD":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"October is calling 📞\n🎟️ https://ow.ly/RuCb50ZToqf","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1790842382784},"3AE7D1D1145CE33B6C92":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"And the goal of the month goes to... CANCELO! 🔥 \n#laligahighlights","type":"videoMessage","timestamp":1790860098885},"3EB00E5167492EC34B8528":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Where football feels like home 💙✨\nls dorsals tenen història, i la història continua ✨","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1790873132803},"3A095E69975FD167EEB5":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Força Barça 💙❤️","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1791101350364},"3AD3325D5E2C06E4D2D4":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"The starting lineup of Barça Femení ahead of #ElClásico 🔵🔴\n\nKick off at 7pm CEST ⌚️","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1791128824746},"3A61BEA026BA39043131":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"VICTÒRIA HISTÒRICA.","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1791140920346},"3A656E23B0891E477D08":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"","type":"questionMessage","timestamp":1791141365914},"3A88BACC0533F373C76C":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"AIXÒ ÉS EL BARÇA","type":"videoMessage","timestamp":1791142491687},"3EB0EE72390B331847B7AC":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Una celebració icònica 😮‍💨","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1791205729915},"3EB09EBE6B7DA5F651273A":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"🇯🇵 ⚽️ Yoichi Takahashi, creator of the animated TV series Captain Tsubasa, drew Lamine Yamal in his iconic manga style.\n🫶 Ha estat un plaer, Yoichi Takahashi \n✍️ Espectacular","type":"videoMessage","timestamp":1791274751994},"3EB040521E46A88A42CC00":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"Ever wanted to ask Gabriel Jesus a question? 🤔\n\nToday, you’ll get your chance!\nOne of Barça’s new signing goes LIVE to answer YOUR questions.\n\n💎 Become a YouTube Member and join the Q&A.\n👉 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V6yxp9bTxRc","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1791277881293},"3A8FC0C9A93F4BCD05CC":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"👀 Your question could be answered by Gabriel Jesus... LIVE.\nToday, he joins us for a LIVE Q&A. 🎙️💬\n💎 Become a Member and ask your question in the chat\n👉 https://www.youtube.com/live/V6yxp9bTxRc\n\nPresented by Google Gemini 🤝","type":"imageMessage","timestamp":1791278829385},"3A68449FFC390F257576":{"sender":"120363160757210405@newsletter","text":"🔴 We’re live! 🎥✨\nWe’re looking forward to your questions! 🙌💬","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1791288768435}},"228531585982709@lid":{"AC755CD45E02A2E62187C1BCD3FF4538":{"sender":"228531585982709@lid","text":"😍","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790337810996},"AC96C3C63FDC2E0B2C793DEF6BC179DC":{"sender":"228531585982709@lid","text":"Eso es mentira","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790337817229},"AC7602F0F3F780FA2AE854B267FFBE11":{"sender":"5491178909546@s.whatsapp.net","text":"😢","type":"reactionMessage","timestamp":1790339741490},"ACB3016ACD237783C13D5CC0525A2FF6":{"sender":"228531585982709@lid","text":"Jajajajajaj","type":"conversation","timestamp":1790340223050},"ACDAF06A48921955232F33F346F8BD42":{"sender":"5491178909546@s.whatsapp.net","text":"😂","type":"reactionMessage","timestamp":1790340541707},"AC42816C66902F60850BDD707D1CF97D":{"sender":"228531585982709@lid","text":"Una gana de un elado","type":"conversation","timestamp":1790340559430},"ACAFA594826FA8A488A31E807CE5C4D4":{"sender":"5491178909546@s.whatsapp.net","text":"Si","type":"extendedTextMessage","timestamp":1790340568